        <name>begin</name>
        <qualifiedname>DHT20::begin</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Initializes the <ref refid="class_d_h_t20" kindref="compound">DHT20</ref> sensor. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function initializes the <ref refid="class_d_h_t20" kindref="compound">DHT20</ref> sensor by waiting for a brief period after power-on and then resetting the sensor.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">None</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="attention"><para>Ensure that the sensor is correctly connected and powered on before calling this function. This function includes a 100ms delay to allow the sensor to stabilize after power-on.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>DHT20_OK</computeroutput>: Initialization success. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
